Download this file: arm-gnu-toolchain-14.2.rel1-mingw-w64-x86_64-arm-none-eabi.exe

Risc-v pico toolchain: https://github.com/raspberrypi/pico-sdk-tools/releases
Download this file: riscv-toolchain-14-x64-win.zip

Python: https://www.python.org/
Install this file:  https://www.python.org/ftp/python/3.13.1/python-3.13.1-amd64.exe

